  "question": {
    "text": "0.02 equivalent of Ag was deposited in an electrolysis experiment. If same quantity of a electricity is passed through a gold solution, 1.314 g of gold is deposited. Find oxidation state of the gold. (Atomic mass of Au = 197)"
