    "text": "<math><mtext>A</mtext><msup><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>→</mo><munder><mrow><mtext>Ag</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1 mol </mtext><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/>0.02 q. of Ag = 0.02 F = 0.02  <math><mo>×</mo></math>  96500 = 1930 C<br/><br/>1.314 Au is deposited by 0.02 F<br/><br/>197 is deposited by  <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.02</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1.314</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>197</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>"
